  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack exhaustion via deeply nested CTEs\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-119371.patch: count CTE expansions in\n       withExpand() and subquery/VIEW result sets in\n       sqlite3ResultSetOfSelect() against SQLITE_LIMIT_EXPR_DEPTH in\n       src/select.c, so an over-deep chain fails with \"VIEWs and/or\n       subqueries nested too deep\" instead of recursing without bound\n     - CVE-2026-119371",
